notes.content:
The following specific issues have been fixed:
- Fixed issues with the tag effects:
    - The effects of Tranquility, Heat, and Beauty of Frost now apply to any non-zero layers, not just those above 0;
    - Attack and Defense now reduce by half at the end of the turn;
    - Agility now reduces layer points cost of active skills. Note that you still need to spend more strategy points than the original cost to use the skill, but the actual cost is reduced;
    - Wound now deals damage after using a skill;
    - Ding now provides numerical gains when active;
    - Quickness now reduces movement cost instead of increasing it.

- Fixed issues with terrain effects, now terrain effects will be correctly applied to units affected by skills, not the ones using the skill.

- Fixed an issue where an error message popped up when using Tenacity.

- Fixed an issue where the buff applied by Tenacity was Protection instead of Defense.

- Updated the skill description and effect of Tenacity and Entanglement.

- Fixed an issue where resources for some side story plots were not loaded correctly.

- Fixed several instances where characters that should have been anonymous were not properly anonymous.

Thank you for participating in the internal testing of "Elysium Above"! We have been working hard to improve the quality and stability of the game. If you have any questions or suggestions, please feel free to contact us.

